            "created_at": "2025-07-12T07:41:05.196025+00:00",
            "notes": "Do not go for  [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124)  quite yet. \n\nWe can build more HPS using blues and greens. You want atleast 10% AS with  [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054), and grab  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a). If you have enough for  [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e), grab that, but if not opt for  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) and/or  [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf).",
