            "created_at": "2025-07-12T07:41:05.196025+00:00",
            "notes": "Round 3 is when the enemy team will start to ramp up significantly, and likely start to focus you and realize you're a huge problem. \n\nYour next power should be  [Serenity](item_c6e1c072-ff50-467e-b59f-9506baea10c1) to get as much survivability as possible from your healing output. \n\nNow it's time to grab  [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124) and start stacking your WP with AS. I usually keep the rare's from round 2 and pick up additional greens.\n\nIf you're struggling to stay alive I usually like to grab  [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) or  [Vishkar Condensor](item_086a91da-b65d-4047-8fc7-28a992078b1d), depending on the opposing teams dps. Both will give you great survivability with  [Serenity](item_c6e1c072-ff50-467e-b59f-9506baea10c1).",
