            "created_at": "2025-07-12T07:41:05.196025+00:00",
            "notes": "If you make it this far you should hopefully be bathing in money. \n\nI usually grab  [Crepuscular Circle](item_c0b93ed2-b692-44d5-a38a-ce5a63e83cdb) since at this point Mercy will get ult fairly quickly. It also is useful to help your team pick off people while you ult. \n\nIf you have the money, upgrade to  [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48) for the 20% AS and get as much WP as you can. \n\nIf I really need survivability I'll throw  [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) or  [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c) in the mix.",
